+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site id. Omitting it selects `main`. An unknown id
+returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Batches, quantities on hand,
+cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use the selected kitchen.
+Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
