+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+The `sites` list contains an id and name for each kitchen. Location ids are
+unique across kitchens. Each location references its kitchen by `site`;
+batches and stock-takes belong to the site of their location. Migration
+assigns every existing location to `main`.
+
 ## Identity

 - Ids are positive integers from `seq` in the store and are never reused,
